                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino meno kikome Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“It malo i wi got man me Abarim, got Nebo, ma tye i lobo Moab mukemo Jeriko, wek inen lobo Kanaan ma abimiyo bot jo Icrael obed megi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibito i wi got ka ma iito iye-ni wek idok bot lutuwu, macalo omeru Aron yam oto i wi got Kor ci odok bot lutugi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pien yam wuŋayo waŋa woko ki i dye jo Icrael, i dog pii me Meribakadec i tim me Jin; yam pe wuwora i nyim jo Icrael macalo an Lubaŋa maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pienno ibineno lobo-nu ki cen i nyimi kuca, ento pe ibicito kunnu, i lobo ma abimiyo ki jo Icrael.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.52"
            ]
          }
        }
